# Phase 1 Plan Amendment A — Blender Asset Pipeline + UI Polish Uplift

> **Companion to:** `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-04-23-phase-1-engine-reset.plan`
> **For agentic workers:** Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax.

**Date:** 2026-04-23
**Triggers:**
1. User has Blender installed on macOS and approved option A sequencing (amend now, keep Blender-independent Tasks 6–21 moving, land asset pipeline before render Tasks 22+).
2. User reiterated the ultimate vision: publish a 90% Re-Volt-like web 3D game with super beautiful UI/UX across mobile / web / PC, deployed on Cloudflare.

**Goal of this amendment:** Upgrade Phase 1 so that (a) cars and props render from real Blender-exported `.glb` assets with baked AO and PBR materials, with a procedural fallback for tests; (b) the shell, HUD, title, and overlays ship a real design system rather than default stat cards; (c) clean-room discipline stays intact — no lifted art, names, or track layouts.

**Non-goals:** Hand-modelling inside this agent session (I drive Blender via headless Python; the user hand-models hero assets such as the Boulevard car). Online multiplayer, track editor, or any scope beyond the original Tier 3 package.

**Summary of changes:**

| ID | Type | Target |
|---|---|---|
| T5.1 | Follow-up | Backfill TrackSchema edge-case tests (5 new tests) |
| T4A | New | Asset pipeline deps: `three/examples/jsm` loaders + ktx2 parser + meshoptimizer + Blender detection |
| T7A | New | `meshAsset` optional field on Track Prop + Car (schema + tests) |
| T11A | New | Blender headless export pipeline (Python + npm run assets:build) |
| T22 | Revised | Prop instancer consumes `.glb`; procedural fallback retained |
| T23 | Revised | Car mesh loads `.glb`; procedural fallback retained |
| T23A | New | `docs/modeling-briefs/boulevard.plan` — modeling brief for the user |
| T25 | Revised | HUD ships a designed surface system (typography, tokens, motion) |
| T26 | Revised | Overlay + title screen ship with design language (ex-functional) |
| T26A | New | Typography + design tokens (`src/style.css` refactor to tokens) |
| T29 | Revised | Sector 18 JSON references GLB prop ids + real lightmap |
| T30 | Revised | Boulevard JSON references `boulevard.glb` |
| T35A | New | Playwright visual regression snapshots for title + track select + car select + finish |

All additions are sequenced into a single cohesive TDD plan below.

